Z||000006||fiero56||03-08-2000||09:06 AM||||I've noticed it takes several weeks for his products to reach his site through the front door.  Rodney posts the pages for us early, but they are not linked to on his site yet.||||reg||1
Z||000007||88 Database Nut||03-08-2000||12:56 PM||||I just happened to email him asking if he was going to start making them, and Shazam!, he tells me that the first ones came in that day!  He shipped them the next morning (Friday) and I got them Mon night.  What a guy!  To reveal the whole story, I had been talking to him about that flap that is above the muffler, and knew he was doing that, but didn't know about the side flaps.  Ima Happy Camper.  Good Luck Guys, shouldn't be too long.||||reg||12
